# Recorded input for the menu bar example page (widgets/menubar.zig, `Example`), at 800 x 600
# in the default theme: the bar at y 0..36; File at x 3..53 and Edit at x 53..102, y 3..33.
# File's list at x 3..75, y 39..163: New (y 42..72), Open (72..101), Recent (101..131), Quit
# (131..160), x 6..72. Edit's list at x 53..109, y 39..104: Undo (y 42..72), Redo (72..101).
# One line per frame says what it does (format: input.Replay). Keys are USB HID: 80 Left,
# 81 Down, 79 Right.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 800 600
dt 0.016
pointer 400 300
# 1: press File
frame
pointer 28 18
buttons left
# 2: release: File's menu opens
frame
buttons
# 3: the pointer reaches Edit: Edit's menu opens instead
frame
pointer 77 18
# 4: Left: File's menu
frame
press 80
# 5: Down: Open
frame
press 81
# 6: the pointer reaches Quit
frame
pointer 39 145
# 7: press it
frame
buttons left
# 8: release: Quit chosen, the menu closes
frame
buttons
# 9: press Edit
frame
pointer 77 18
buttons left
# 10: release: Edit's menu opens
frame
buttons
# 11: Right: wraps to File's menu
frame
press 79
# 12: press outside: closed
frame
pointer 400 300
buttons left
